  "excerpt": "Applebee’s $9.99 Daily Specials: Get a Really Big Meal Deal with Endless Fries and a Drink If you love casual restaurants that offer great value, you probably know that the Applebee’s 9.99 daily specials are some of the best meal deals around. From a juicy burger with endless fries to a crispy chicken breast sandwich … Read more",
  "html": "<h1>Applebee’s $9.99 Daily Specials: Get a Really Big Meal Deal with Endless Fries and a Drink</h1>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2297\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2297\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2297\" src=\"/img/wp/399917c92f-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-35pm.webp\" alt=\"A delicious Applebee&#039;s bacon cheeseburger with endless fries, boneless wings, and an iced tea on a wooden table in a restaurant setting.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/399917c92f-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-35pm.webp 1024w, /img/wp/ada7861f2c-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-35pm-3.webp 300w, /img/wp/4a63e475b6-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-35pm-1.webp 150w, /img/wp/f8de0d93b2-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-35pm-7.webp 768w, /img/wp/0302096c44-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-35pm-5.webp 500w, /img/wp/779992088a-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-35pm-1.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2297\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Enjoy Applebee&#8217;s 9.99 Daily Specials: A really big meal deal featuring a juicy bacon cheeseburger, endless golden fries, flavorful boneless wings, and a refreshing iced tea, all served in a casual and inviting restaurant atmosphere.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>If you love casual restaurants that offer great value, you probably know that the Applebee’s 9.99 daily specials are some of the best meal deals around. From a juicy burger with endless fries to a crispy chicken breast sandwich or boneless wings, this chain always finds ways to surprise you with fresh promotions and special menu options.</p><p>This complete guide explains everything about the 9.99 really big meal deal — what’s on the menu, when you can get it, and how to enjoy every bite for less. So if you’ve been searching for a budget-friendly lunch special or dinner special near you, keep reading to plan your next dine-in visit.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>The Applebee’s 9.99 Deal: What Makes It Special</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2298\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2298\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2298\" src=\"/img/wp/036de29c26-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-35pm-1.webp\" alt=\" Close-up of an Applebee&#039;s bacon cheeseburger with fries and a drink on a wooden table, with happy diners and a server in the background.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/036de29c26-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-35pm-1.webp 1024w, /img/wp/d1256514e0-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-35pm-1.webp 300w, /img/wp/a8ce66c95e-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-35pm-1.webp 150w, /img/wp/ec5770c2d5-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-35pm-1.webp 768w, /img/wp/1930dfe921-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-35pm-1.webp 500w, /img/wp/c0fa1754e2-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-35pm-1.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2298\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Experience the special Applebee&#8217;s 9.99 deal, featuring a mouth-watering bacon cheeseburger, a generous serving of fries, and a refreshing drink, all presented on a rustic wooden table with the lively restaurant ambiance in the background.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>At the heart of Applebee’s 9.99 deal is its promise: a satisfying meal, fries and a drink, all for under ten dollars. This classic meal deal includes some of your favorite menu items, including the popular bacon cheeseburger, whole lotta bacon burger, and crispy chicken sandwich.</p>\n<p>While prices may vary by location, the 9.99 really big meal deal is generally available at participating locations for a limited time. So be sure to check with your local Applebee’s restaurant to confirm what’s on the special menu today.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>What’s Included in the 9.99 Really Big Meal Deal</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2299\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2299\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2299\" src=\"/img/wp/dc17d626bb-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-35pm-2.webp\" alt=\"An Applebee&#039;s 9.99 meal deal with a bacon cheeseburger, endless fries, boneless wings, and iced tea, served on a wooden table with blurred diners in the background.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/dc17d626bb-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-35pm-2.webp 1024w, /img/wp/4cf6c063fa-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-35pm-2.webp 300w, /img/wp/e45ed7b269-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-35pm-2.webp 150w, /img/wp/caecda8a86-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-35pm-2.webp 768w, /img/wp/7dc4d89cbe-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-35pm-2.webp 500w, /img/wp/4e3ace1116-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-35pm-2.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2299\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">What&#8217;s included in Applebee&#8217;s Really Big Meal Deal: A delicious bacon cheeseburger, a side of crispy fries, a serving of boneless wings, and a tall glass of iced tea, all artfully arranged on a wooden table, promising a delightful dining experience.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The Applebee’s really big meal deal usually comes with these tasty choices:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>burger or sandwich (like a bacon cheeseburger or grilled chicken breast)</li>\n<li>endless fries</li>\n<li>soft drink or iced tea</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You can mix and match to create a combo that suits your cravings. Many fans love pairing a burger and fries with boneless wings or a side appetizer for a casual big meal that doesn’t break the bank.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>Typical Menu Items for the Applebee’s 9.99 Specials</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2300\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2300\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2300\" src=\"/img/wp/2168b75c7a-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-35pm-3.webp\" alt=\" A spread of Applebee&#039;s 9.99 daily specials, including a bacon cheeseburger, crispy chicken sandwich, fries, and boneless wings, with diners in the background.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/2168b75c7a-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-35pm-3.webp 1024w, /img/wp/4d37aea83d-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-35pm-3.webp 300w, /img/wp/554bc8a0fe-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-35pm-3.webp 150w, /img/wp/74dc07d107-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-35pm-3.webp 768w, /img/wp/b1709c008e-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-35pm-3.webp 500w, /img/wp/b61af97fcc-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-35pm-3.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2300\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Explore the typical menu items for Applebee&#8217;s 9.99 specials, showcasing a mouth-watering array of options including a classic bacon cheeseburger, a crispy chicken sandwich, golden fries, and succulent boneless wings, all set in a vibrant restaurant atmosphere.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Here’s a sample of what you might find when ordering the 9.99 daily specials at your local chain:</p>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_80l1q_1\">\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_80l1q_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th data-col-size=\"sm\">Menu Item</th>\n<th data-col-size=\"sm\">Includes</th>\n<th data-col-size=\"sm\">Price</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">Classic bacon cheeseburger</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">Endless fries and a drink</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">$9.99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">Whole lotta bacon burger</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">Endless fries and a drink</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">$9.99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">New big cheeseburger</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">Fries and a drink</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">$9.99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">Crispy chicken sandwich</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">Fries and a drink</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">$9.99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">Grilled chicken breast sandwich</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">Fries and a drink</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">$9.99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">Boneless wings combo</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">Fries and a drink</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">$9.99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">Big cluckin’ chicken breast combo</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">Fries and a drink</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\">$9.99</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>Some locations even offer seasonal promotions like a burger and fries deal for $10.99 with a premium topping or extra side.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>When Can You Get the Applebee’s $9.99 Burger Deal</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2301\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2301\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2301\" src=\"/img/wp/adb87c3f49-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm.webp\" alt=\"Diners enjoying Applebee&#039;s 9.99 burger deal on a Tuesday, with a chalkboard sign advertising &quot;Today&#039;s Specials: Tuesday: $9.99 Burger Deal.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/adb87c3f49-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm.webp 1024w, /img/wp/60f1e3dda5-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-3.webp 300w, /img/wp/ac75318463-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-1.webp 150w, /img/wp/ba4afe5e5a-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-7.webp 768w, /img/wp/33da63a2e5-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-5.webp 500w, /img/wp/10cbf03c84-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-1.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2301\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Discover when you can get the Applebee&#8217;s $9.99 burger deal! A vibrant image of friends enjoying their meals in a cozy Applebee&#8217;s setting, with a chalkboard proudly announcing &#8220;Today&#8217;s Specials: Tuesday: $9.99 Burger Deal,&#8221; making it clear that Tuesdays are the day for this amazing offer.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>One reason this really big meal deal is so popular is its consistent availability. Many restaurants run the 9.99 burger special every Tuesday, but it’s common to find daily specials today or on other weekdays too.</p>\n<p>So if you’re planning a casual dine-in lunch or dinner this week, check whether your local Applebee’s has specials today. This promotion is popular because it often overlaps with happy hour, giving you even more value.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>Burger Specials That Make It a Really Big Deal</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2302\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2302\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2302\" src=\"/img/wp/7d6404a806-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-1.webp\" alt=\"A variety of Applebee&#039;s burger specials, including a bacon cheeseburger, a new big cheeseburger with onion rings, fries, and boneless wings, served to happy diners.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/7d6404a806-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-1.webp 1024w, /img/wp/1bd523605b-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-1.webp 300w, /img/wp/0778fea171-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-1.webp 150w, /img/wp/dd823147a6-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-1.webp 768w, /img/wp/44ca5446c8-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-1.webp 500w, /img/wp/32dee20f70-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-1.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2302\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Explore burger specials that make it a really big deal at Applebee&#8217;s, featuring a mouth-watering array of options including the classic bacon cheeseburger, a new big cheeseburger topped with crispy onion rings, golden fries, and succulent boneless wings, all served to delighted diners in a lively restaurant setting.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Let’s break down a few popular options in the 9.99 burger line-up:</p>\n<h3>Classic bacon cheeseburger</h3>\n<p>A classic for good reason. The bacon cheeseburger is layered with crisp bacon, melted cheese, fresh lettuce and tomato, pickles, and a toasted bun. The fries and a drink combo make this meal feel really big without the big price tag.</p>\n<h3>Whole lotta bacon burger</h3>\n<p>If you love bacon, this is the one to try. The whole lotta bacon burger comes with extra strips of smoky bacon, cheddar cheese, bacon aioli, and a hearty burger patty. Add endless fries for the ultimate burger special.</p>\n<h3>New big cheeseburger</h3>\n<p>Some participating locations roll out a new big cheeseburger for a limited time. This updated twist on a classic cheeseburger often comes with premium toppings like crispy onion rings or a spicy sauce.</p>\n<h3>Crispy chicken sandwich</h3>\n<p>Not every diner wants beef. That’s where the crispy chicken sandwich comes in — juicy, breaded chicken breast with fresh veggies and your choice of sauce. Perfect when you want something different than a burger.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>What About Chicken? More Than Just Burgers</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2303\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2303\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2303\" src=\"/img/wp/9494690a80-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-2.webp\" alt=\"Applebee&#039;s chicken options, including a crispy chicken sandwich, grilled chicken breast sandwich with green beans, fries, boneless wings, and iced tea, with diners in the background.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/9494690a80-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-2.webp 1024w, /img/wp/55efa53a9c-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-2.webp 300w, /img/wp/0add432164-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-2.webp 150w, /img/wp/3778695bc0-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-2.webp 768w, /img/wp/40ea332262-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-2.webp 500w, /img/wp/5b9c04bdef-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-2.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2303\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Discover Applebee&#8217;s chicken options: More than just burgers, the spread includes a crispy chicken sandwich, a healthy grilled chicken breast sandwich with green beans, golden fries, a basket of boneless wings, and a refreshing iced tea, all laid out on a wooden table, promising a delightful meal for every palate.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>If you’re not in the mood for burgers, you can still enjoy the really big meal deal. Many Applebee’s restaurants include options like the grilled chicken breast sandwich or the big cluckin’ chicken combo. Both come with fries and a drink for 9.99, and sometimes you’ll see a boneless wings basket or appetizer combo as part of the special menu too.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>Endless Fries and All-You-Can-Eat Perks</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2304\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2304\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2304\" src=\"/img/wp/cfdec87a14-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-3.webp\" alt=\"An Applebee&#039;s server happily refilling a diner&#039;s basket with endless fries, highlighting the all-you-can-eat perk, while other diners enjoy their meals.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/cfdec87a14-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-3.webp 1024w, /img/wp/8b7ca9c41a-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-3.webp 300w, /img/wp/e979c1d1bd-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-3.webp 150w, /img/wp/1b439f7892-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-3.webp 768w, /img/wp/cff7da9f48-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-3.webp 500w, /img/wp/5245a7fb6c-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-3.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2304\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Experience the ultimate all-you-can-eat perk at Applebee&#8217;s: endless fries! A cheerful server is captured in the act of refilling a diner&#8217;s basket with hot, crispy fries, while other patrons in the background enjoy their meals in the restaurant&#8217;s inviting ambiance.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>One feature diners love is the endless fries. When you order a burger meal or sandwich meal deal for dine-in, you can often request free fry refills. Many locations promote the fries and a drink as all-you-can-eat for dine-in customers, so don’t be shy — just ask your server for another round of hot, crispy fries.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>Applebee’s Happy Hour and Other Promotions</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2305\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2305\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2305\" src=\"/img/wp/72aa5e7899-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-4.webp\" alt=\"Friends toasting drinks during Applebee&#039;s Happy Hour, with a spread of appetizers, fries, and discounted drinks on the table, and a &quot;Happy Hour 2-for-1 Drinks&quot; sign in the background.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/72aa5e7899-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-4.webp 1024w, /img/wp/5a69c45377-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-4.webp 300w, /img/wp/e4eac76c0b-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-4.webp 150w, /img/wp/3055548f3b-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-4.webp 768w, /img/wp/8df5c9c0f5-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-4.webp 500w, /img/wp/6a0c65d3cf-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-36pm-4.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2305\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Dive into Applebee&#8217;s Happy Hour and other promotions! Friends are seen toasting their drinks, surrounded by a delectable spread of appetizers, crispy fries, and discounted beverages, all illuminated by a vibrant &#8220;Happy Hour 2-for-1 Drinks&#8221; sign in the background, promising a lively and affordable dining experience.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Applebee’s is a casual chain known for its daily deals and happy hour specials. You’ll often find that the 9.99 burger deal overlaps with their happy hour menu, which might include discounted appetizers, boneless wings, or even 2-for-1 drinks. This makes it easy to enjoy a meal deal and a drink for less than you’d spend at most fast food spots.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>How to Find Specials Near You</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2306\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2306\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2306\" src=\"/img/wp/3c372d2135-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-42pm.webp\" alt=\"Hands holding a smartphone displaying the Applebee&#039;s app with a &quot;Daily Deals: $9.99 Big Meal Combo&quot; banner, in front of an Applebee&#039;s restaurant.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/3c372d2135-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-42pm.webp 1024w, /img/wp/3632a28d51-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-42pm-3.webp 300w, /img/wp/937b8f0743-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-42pm-1.webp 150w, /img/wp/ad01cac04f-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-42pm-7.webp 768w, /img/wp/ae961d461c-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-42pm-5.webp 500w, /img/wp/c43c27cea0-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-42pm-1.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2306\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Easily find Applebee&#8217;s daily deals and specials near you using their website or app.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Always remember that promotions may vary by location. While many Applebee’s offer the 9.99 really big meal deal every Tuesday, others might have unique burger specials or lunch specials on different days.</p>\n<p>To make sure you’re getting the current deal, contact your local Applebee’s restaurant. You can also check their website or social media for updates on daily specials, seasonal deals, and limited-time offers.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>Tips for Making the Most of the $9.99 Burger Deal</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2307\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2307\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2307\" src=\"/img/wp/965d4287d9-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-42pm-1.webp\" alt=\" Group of happy friends toasting beers and enjoying burgers, fries, and boneless wings at an Applebee&#039;s restaurant.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/965d4287d9-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-42pm-1.webp 1024w, /img/wp/f00e599dd1-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-42pm-1.webp 300w, /img/wp/7947da2700-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-42pm-1.webp 150w, /img/wp/eb638a8f92-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-42pm-1.webp 768w, /img/wp/4175f1411d-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-42pm-1.webp 500w, /img/wp/c26067c703-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-42pm-1.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2307\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Maximize your savings on the Applebee&#8217;s $9.99 burger deal by visiting on Tuesdays, combining with happy hour, and bringing friends.</figcaption></figure>\n<ul>\n<li>Visit on a Tuesday or during weekday lunch specials to get the best price.</li>\n<li>Ask about seasonal promotions — like adding a premium topping or appetizer for a small upcharge.</li>\n<li>Combine the burger deal with happy hour specials for extra savings.</li>\n<li>Bring friends to share different menu items and try more than one sandwich or burger.</li>\n<li>Dine in when you want endless fries — this perk is usually for dine-in only.</li>\n<li>Join the Applebee’s email list to get alerts about new big meal deals or promotions near you.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h2>Why Customers Love This Casual Chain</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2308\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2308\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2308\" src=\"/img/wp/d88ac531d7-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-42pm-2.webp\" alt=\"Happy diners enjoying various burgers, crispy chicken sandwiches, and golden fries at a casual Applebee&#039;s restaurant setting.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/d88ac531d7-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-42pm-2.webp 1024w, /img/wp/f8eb65cf6f-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-42pm-2.webp 300w, /img/wp/0ac2656e87-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-42pm-2.webp 150w, /img/wp/944f0c28c3-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-42pm-2.webp 768w, /img/wp/40b8127100-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-42pm-2.webp 500w, /img/wp/4f1271028a-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-42pm-2.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2308\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Applebee&#8217;s remains a favorite for its unbeatable value, variety of satisfying meals, and comfortable dining experience.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Applebee’s continues to be one of America’s favorite casual restaurants because it delivers on value and variety. From the classic bacon cheeseburger to the whole lotta bacon burger and crispy chicken sandwich, every 9.99 meal deal feels satisfying and affordable.</p>\n<p>Many diners appreciate the comfortable setting, reliable service, and the fact that the meal deal includes fries and a drink at no extra charge. For students, families, or anyone on a budget, the really big meal deal is a clear winner.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>Applebee’s Meal Deals</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2309\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2309\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2309\" src=\"/img/wp/68b6ae6214-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm.webp\" alt=\"A delicious spread of Applebee&#039;s meal deals including a premium burger with onion rings, a crispy chicken sandwich, loaded fries, boneless wings, and drinks, with a small sign showing &quot;$10.99&quot;.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/68b6ae6214-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm.webp 1024w, /img/wp/c9e1be58f4-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-3.webp 300w, /img/wp/84f22ccc35-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-1.webp 150w, /img/wp/7b5c204755-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-7.webp 768w, /img/wp/c0507da693-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-5.webp 500w, /img/wp/5fbe9ffccf-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-1.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2309\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Explore Applebee&#8217;s latest meal deals featuring new big burger specials, premium toppings, and satisfying combos at great prices.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>This year, expect even more new big burger specials and meal combos. Many locations are testing seasonal offers that may feature a premium burger and fries for 10.99, extra toppings, or unique sandwiches like the big cluckin’ chicken breast combo.</p>\n<p>So if you’re searching for burger specials today, lunch specials, or dinner specials that won’t empty your wallet, make Applebee’s your next stop.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>Additional Deals Available Near You</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2310\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2310\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2310\" src=\"/img/wp/6e217729d1-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-1.webp\" alt=\"A family enjoying a meal at Applebee&#039;s, with a table full of food and small signs advertising &quot;Happy Hour 1/2 Price Boneless Wings,&quot; &quot;Seasonal Appetizers 5\no\nr\nl\ne\ns\ns\n,\n&quot;\na\nn\nd\n&quot;\n5orless,&quot;and&quot;\n1 Side Upgrades.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/6e217729d1-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-1.webp 1024w, /img/wp/3fb04a5350-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-1.webp 300w, /img/wp/5198a876c5-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-1.webp 150w, /img/wp/c3d094127f-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-1.webp 768w, /img/wp/642359ebf4-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-1.webp 500w, /img/wp/9e88f1354b-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-1.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2310\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Discover additional limited-time promotions at Applebee&#8217;s, including seasonal appetizers, happy hour boneless wings, and kids-eat-free nights.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Besides the 9.99 burger and sandwich combo, some Applebee’s locations offer limited-time promotions like:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Seasonal appetizers for $5 or less</li>\n<li>Happy hour half-price boneless wings</li>\n<li>Kids-eat-free nights</li>\n<li>Combo upgrades with premium sides for only a dollar more</li>\n</ul>\n<p>These extra deals make it easy to create a really big meal deal for the whole family.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>Best Times to Visit</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2311\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2311\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2311\" src=\"/img/wp/05b8ed7a55-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-2.webp\" alt=\"A smiling woman enjoying a burger and fries at an Applebee&#039;s booth during a quieter time, with a small chalkboard sign recommending &quot;Best Times to Visit: Mid-Week &amp; Late Lunch.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/05b8ed7a55-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-2.webp 1024w, /img/wp/2a0f262db5-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-2.webp 300w, /img/wp/76905aa52b-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-2.webp 150w, /img/wp/43ac73e87a-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-2.webp 768w, /img/wp/67cdba547d-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-2.webp 500w, /img/wp/1c1927a22c-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-2.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2311\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Enjoy faster service and fresh fries by visiting Applebee&#8217;s during mid-week or late lunch hours to skip the rush.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>If you want to skip the rush, try visiting mid-week or during late lunch hours. Many casual restaurants are busiest on weekends, but you can often enjoy faster service and fresh fries if you dine in during quieter times.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>Do All Locations Offer the 9.99 Deal?</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2312\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2312\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2312\" src=\"/img/wp/7a3a4d7af9-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-3.webp\" alt=\"A collage showing different Applebee&#039;s dining scenes and small chalkboard signs indicating varying deals: &quot;$9.99 Really Big Meal Deal - Available Tuesdays&quot; and &quot;Burger &amp; Wings Combo $10.99 - Daily Lunch Special,&quot; with text &quot;DEALS VARY BY LOCATION!&quot; in the center.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/7a3a4d7af9-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-3.webp 1024w, /img/wp/409500fbcd-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-3.webp 300w, /img/wp/96e723d176-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-3.webp 150w, /img/wp/dc9c1d58de-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-3.webp 768w, /img/wp/c7527369de-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-3.webp 500w, /img/wp/372d956b7e-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-3.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2312\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Promotions and the $9.99 deal may vary by Applebee&#8217;s location; always confirm with your local restaurant.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Not every Applebee’s has the same daily specials. Some restaurants may run promotions for a limited time, while others have a regular Tuesday burger special all year. Always check ahead by calling or visiting your neighborhood restaurant online.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>Contact Your Local Applebee’s Restaurant</h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_2313\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-2313\" style=\"width: 640px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2313\" src=\"/img/wp/56846f392e-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-4.webp\" alt=\"A person holding a smartphone displaying the Applebee&#039;s app with &quot;Contact Us&quot; information, next to a chalkboard sign that reads &quot;TODAY&#039;S SPECIALS: $9.99 Really Big Meal Deal (Burger, Fries &amp; Drink) - Ask About Endless Fries! Call to Confirm!&quot; with an Applebee&#039;s restaurant in the background.\" width=\"650\" height=\"650\" title=\"\" srcset=\"/img/wp/56846f392e-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-4.webp 1024w, /img/wp/2c24ca3738-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-4.webp 300w, /img/wp/415222b137-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-4.webp 150w, /img/wp/c28fe7e741-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-4.webp 768w, /img/wp/ecf5a276cb-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-4.webp 500w, /img/wp/628f38f9d2-generated-image-october-16-2025-8-43pm-4.webp 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2313\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Always contact your local Applebee’s directly to confirm current burger specials, endless fries availability, and premium upgrades.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Before heading out for your next 9.99 meal deal, it’s smart to contact your local Applebee’s restaurant. They can tell you which burger specials are available, whether endless fries are included, and if any premium upgrades are on the special menu that day.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>Final Thoughts: Why the 9.99 Really Big Meal Deal is Worth It</h2>\n<p>A full meal with a burger and fries, a drink, and sometimes even an appetizer, all for under ten dollars — that’s why so many people love Applebee’s 9.99 daily specials. They offer unbeatable value, a comfortable dining experience, and plenty of menu choices, whether you want a bacon cheeseburger, crispy chicken sandwich, or a new big twist on a classic burger.</p>\n<p>So if you’re craving comfort food, skip fast food for a day and head to Applebee’s. Check the deals near you, pick your favorite combo, and get ready to enjoy a really big meal deal for less.</p>\n<hr />\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-22\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @[37rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @[72rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:32rem] @[34rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @[64rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"4e21ec70-d46b-49ed-91c0-279fad13e2c1\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light\">\n<pre><em>Looking for quick and delicious meal ideas? Browse our <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" href=\"/easy-recipes/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\">easy recipes</a> collection for simple dishes anyone can make at home.</em></pre>\n<hr />\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n<h2>FAQs About the 9.99 Special</h2>\n<p><strong>When is the Applebee’s 9.99 burger deal available?</strong><br />Most locations run the deal every Tuesday, but some offer it daily or during lunch specials.</p>\n<p><strong>What does the 9.99 really big meal deal include?</strong><br />A burger or sandwich, endless fries or regular fries, and a drink. Some combos even include boneless wings or an appetizer.</p>\n<p><strong>Is the fries and a drink combo all-you-can-eat?</strong><br />Endless fries are typically dine-in only. Always ask your server.</p>\n<p><strong>Can I get the deal to go?</strong><br />Some locations allow takeout for the 9.99 burger special, but endless fries may be dine-in only.</p>\n<p><strong>Are there seasonal burger specials?</strong><br />Yes, participating restaurants often run new big burgers or limited-time sandwiches throughout the year.</p>",
